---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro'
---

<DocsLayout title="Docs — WhisperQueue">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-medium">Documentation</h1>

  <p class="mt-4 text-wq-muted">
    WhisperQueue is a self-hosted async transcription microservice built in TypeScript/Bun
    that wraps faster-whisper CLI for GPU-accelerated audio transcription.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
    <a href="/docs/api" class="block rounded-xl border border-wq-border bg-wq-surface p-5 transition-colors duration-150 hover:border-wq-accent">
      <div class="font-medium">API reference</div>
      <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-wq-muted">Endpoints, request/response formats, and usage examples</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/caching" class="block rounded-xl border border-wq-border bg-wq-surface p-5 transition-colors duration-150 hover:border-wq-accent">
      <div class="font-medium">Caching</div>
      <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-wq-muted">ETag-based caching strategy — skip GPU entirely on cache hits</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/auth" class="block rounded-xl border border-wq-border bg-wq-surface p-5 transition-colors duration-150 hover:border-wq-accent">
      <div class="font-medium">Auth</div>
      <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-wq-muted">Static API key authentication via Bearer header</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/errors" class="block rounded-xl border border-wq-border bg-wq-surface p-5 transition-colors duration-150 hover:border-wq-accent">
      <div class="font-medium">Error codes</div>
      <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-wq-muted">HTTP status codes and what they mean</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/deployment" class="block rounded-xl border border-wq-border bg-wq-surface p-5 transition-colors duration-150 hover:border-wq-accent">
      <div class="font-medium">Deployment</div>
      <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-wq-muted">Docker Compose setup, configuration, and volume management</div>
    </a>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>